/T (5.1.2 Overview of responsibilities of Developer   The developer for the blockchain-based SmartShelf system is responsible for creating and implementing smart contracts using Solidity, integrating them with the React.js front-end application, and ensuring the system operates securely and efficiently. They collaborate with the team to deliver a seamless user experience, perform thorough testing to identify and fix bugs, follow industry best practices, and adhere to coding standards to provide a robust and reliable decentralized digital library solution.)
/E (5.1.2 Overview of responsibilities of Developer   The developer for the blockchain-based SmartShelf system is responsible for creating and implementing smart contracts using Solidity, integrating them with the React.js front-end application, and ensuring the system operates securely and efficiently. They collaborate with the team to deliver a seamless user experience, perform thorough testing to identify and fix bugs, follow industry best practices, and adhere to coding standards to provide a robust and reliable decentralized digital library solution.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [6]
>>
