453 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (A user who wants to access or purchase a digital book is a usage scenario for the SmartShelf system using blockchain technology. They open the web application built with React.js, set up a secure account using MetaMask for authentication, and browse or select the desired book. The system uses smart contracts to verify the transaction, record ownership, and distribute royalties to the author automatically. This ensures the integrity of digital content transactions and creates an immutable, transparent record of book ownership and access history.)
/E (A user who wants to access or purchase a digital book is a usage scenario for the SmartShelf system using blockchain technology. They open the web application built with React.js, set up a secure account using MetaMask for authentication, and browse or select the desired book. The system uses smart contracts to verify the transaction, record ownership, and distribute royalties to the author automatically. This ensures the integrity of digital content transactions and creates an immutable, transparent record of book ownership and access history.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [18]
>>
